# Ignore out/ and data/ folders at any depth
**/out/
**/data/
**/DriverMonitoringDataset/

# Also ignore model checkpoints
**/model_checkpoints/
# Compiled QEMU plugin artifacts (built from source in the Docker image)
_Tools/qemu_plugin/*.so
